{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他在亲近后的安适里渐渐出神，心思也松弛下来。尝过真实的满足后，这次他更能自在地停留在亲近本身。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"亲近带来的满足能让他放松、沉浸，也使他更愿意停留其中。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这与本段以安适、出神为主的听感贴合，也把前面的满足推进为更松弛的沉浸。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选13\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜里渐渐多了一点牵挂，他开始担心这份亲近会失去。尝过它带来的安适后，失去它也就有了分量。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"这份亲近已成为他珍惜、也害怕失去的东西。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前面的满足足以让亲近变得珍贵，但将细微的不安具体解释为害怕失去，仍比安适本身多一步推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选10\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7de5fc8d-b56c-4b15-ad35-2f8dc3bfe8a1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T033427278888Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:36:03.665992+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a648c19cefca8661d152035623f179553edd7d44edc250fae02cfd29876aefdf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c